  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5028.01 Special Structures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5028.01 Special Structures. All displays of display fireworks from rooftops, bridges, towers, stadiums, parking decks, other structures or limited egress locations shall be conducted in accordance with NFPA 1123, Code for Display Fireworks, 2014 edition, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5000.html"
